{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And the stones shall be according to the names of the children of Israel.</b> When the donors consecrate them, their consecration shall be for the purpose that the names of the tribes be inscribed upon them." "<b>Twelve according to their names.</b> And they shall be twelve corresponding to their names — no fewer and no more." "<b>Engravings of a signet, each according to its name.</b> And likewise the engraver shall engrave the stone of each one according to its name, and shall exchange neither the stone nor the intended inscription from one to another."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:29.544372961Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}